  characterName: Axion
  dialogues:
  - Incredible job! I'm starting to see why they hired you.
  - With this the ENCODER is finished, creating an embedding which contains all the
    contextual, semantic, and syntactical information about the starting sequence
    of resources.
  - The final component we will have to make in order to have a functioning TRANSFORMER
    is the DECODER, which you will be making next...
